      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Mennonite farmers from Germany and Russia settled Fairmead, drawn by fertile soil and irrigation, shaping its early crop focus on alfalfa and dairy.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
