      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A creamery, cheese factory, lumber yard, and implement dealers sprang up quickly, supporting dairy production and general farming in the early years.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/fairmead_california",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The community’s soils are fine‑loamy Madera series with high clay, causing shrink‑swell and a water table that rises 3–6 feet in winter, leading to seasonal ponding.",
